ORIGIN
------

SodaFlow is derived from Sodium, a Functional Reactive Programming library
created by Stephen Blackheath and Anthony Jones:

    https://github.com/SodiumFRP/sodium

Sodium is Copyright (c) 2012-2015 Stephen Blackheath and Anthony Jones and is
used here under the BSD 3-Clause License. That license applies to both the
original work and to SodaFlow; its full text is in the LICENSE file, which
must be retained in all source and binary redistributions of SodaFlow.

SodaFlow began as the .NET (C# and F#) implementation within the Sodium
repository and retains that implementation's full commit history. The original
C# port was contributed by Michael Lund in 2014; the implementation was
substantially rewritten and has been maintained since 2016 by MorseCode
Software LLC. Additional contributions were made by Stephen Blackheath and
Bastian Moldenhauer.

